+SpaceX Aegis Security Plan (summary)
+
+Key controls:
+- BYOK/HSM for signing keys (Vault auto-unseal via KMS or PKCS#11 HSM provider). Dual control for production key usage.
+- Dedicated US-only tenant (VPC) with no public egress; VPC endpoints for necessary services.
